# Environment

Nothing in this file is required for the demo path. Every command talks to
FalkorDB on `localhost:6379` unless told otherwise, there is no dotenv loader,
and there is no LLM call anywhere — the labeler is a rules table, not a model
(see `AI_DISCLOSURE.md`). No API keys are needed or read.

The guard's tests are the only code that reads environment, so CI and
alternate setups can point them at a different instance:

```
FALKOR_HOST=localhost
FALKOR_PORT=6379
```

Never commit a real `.env` — it is git-ignored regardless.
